     <draw:text-box>
      <text:p text:style-name="P57"><text:span text:style-name="T26">A house is a building where people live. It usually has rooms like a kitchen, bedroom, and bathroom. For example, &apos;My family lives in a house.&apos; </text:span></text:p>
